    "summary": "As [either player's Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) ends, if this **TRANSPORT** has no models embarked within it, you can pick a **YNNARI INFANTRY** unit of yours that:\n\n- has only models from the units named in this model's Transport ability\n- has 6 models or fewer\n- lies wholly within 6\" of it\n\nIf that unit is not in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of any enemy unit, it can [embark](vsdata:core-rule/embarking) in this **TRANSPORT**, even if it disembarked from it this turn.",
